ux kernel drm/sti 错误指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM/STI 显示子系统的 sti_gdp_atomic_check 函数中存在错误指针解引用漏洞。drm_atomic_get_crtc_state() 函数在特定失败情况下会返回错误指针，而 sti_gdp_atomic_check 未对返回值进行有效性检查，直接使用该指针进行操作，导致内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过加载特制的显示状态触发该错误路径，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。需更新至包含修复补丁的内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56777"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18.560","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:58.133","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64 或 6.12.4 及以上（对应修复 commit: 3cf2e7c44、997b64c3f、b79612ed6、e965e771b、f5804567c）。使用 apt/yum 等包管理器更新内核包后重启系统即可生效。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 STI 显示驱动模块（modprobe -r sti）作为临时缓解措施，但会导致 STI 图形输出不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3cf2e7c448e246f7e700c7aa47450d1e27579559","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/997b64c3f4c1827c5cfda8ae7f5d13f78d28b541","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b79612ed6bc1a184c45427105c851b5b2d4342ca","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e965e771b069421c233d674c3c8cd8c7f7245f42","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f5804567cf9605d6e5ec46c0bb786f7d50f18c13","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56777.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56777.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56777.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56777","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56777.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56777.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56777-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56777.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-w4pw-p565-4p8w/GHSA-w4pw-p565-4p8w.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56777"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0580.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0579","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56776","title":"Linux kernel DRM/STI 错误指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM 子系统中 STI 显示驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞，drm_atomic_get_crtc_state() 函数在内存分配失败或参数异常时可能返回错误指针（ERR_PTR），但驱动未对返回值进行有效性检查便直接解引用，导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过触发特定的 DRM 原子操作来利用此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56776"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18.447","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:57.967","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64、6.12.4 或 6.13 及以上。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新，例如 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 或执行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-*`；Debian 用户参考 DLA-4045-1 公告更新内核包。更新后需重启系统生效。如无法立即更新，可卸载或禁用 sti 内核模块（`modprobe -r sti`）作为临时缓解措施，但可能影响显示输出功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/40725c5fabee804fecce41d4d5c5bae80c45e1c4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/831214f77037de02afc287eae93ce97f218d8c04","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8ab73ac97c0fa528f66eeccd9bb53eb6eb7d20dc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e98ff67f5a68114804607de549c2350d27628fc7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f67786293193cf01ebcc6fdbcbd1587b24f52679","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/m