:57.820","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.4 或更高版本（包含补丁 commit 8cb2f6793845f 和 27227a234c14）。各发行版用户：Ubuntu 安装 USN-7381-1/USN-7450-1 安全更新，RHEL/CentOS 使用 `yum update kernel`，Debian 使用 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image`，更新后重启系统。如无法立即升级，可通过内核模块黑名单临时禁用 amdgpu 驱动：`echo \"blacklist amdgpu\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-amdgpu.conf && update-initramfs -u`，但此措施将禁用 AMD 图形加速功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/27227a234c1487cb7a684615f0749c455218833a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8cb2f6793845f135b28361ba8e96901cae3e5790","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56775.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56775.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56775.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56775.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56775","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56775.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56775.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-56775-drmamddisplay-fix-handling-of-plane-1767883807000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-pm49-6j2c-6857/GHSA-pm49-6j2c-6857.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56775"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_u